%% Implemented Sfumato v0.2 slide generation sequence.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as CLI or TUI
    participant App as SfumatoApplication
    participant Config as EffectiveConfigResolver
    participant Assets as ProjectAssetCatalog
    participant Image as Image provider
    participant Source as SourceReader
    participant Prompt as PromptCatalog
    participant Agent as AgentRunner
    participant Deck as DeckDocument
    participant Render as Diagram and Slide renderers
    participant Tx as ArtifactTransaction
    participant Publish as WorkspaceFileSystem

    Client->>App: generate_slides(command)
    App->>Config: resolve(command overrides)
    Config-->>App: EffectiveConfig
    App->>Assets: resolve exact-theme then wildcard variants
    opt missing themed variant has a regeneration recipe
        App->>Prompt: render artifact regeneration prompt
        App->>Image: generate variant with active theme tokens
        App->>Assets: cache content-addressed themed variant
    end
    App->>Source: read bounded sources and SFUMATO.md
    Source-->>App: deterministic source bundle and warnings
    App->>Prompt: render draft pair
    Prompt-->>App: messages and provenance
    App->>Agent: run draft with declared tools
    opt provider context or output limit
        App->>Prompt: render compact draft pair
        App->>Agent: run compact draft
    end
    Agent-->>App: draft Markdown
    App->>Deck: normalize and validate
    opt invalid draft with recoverable structure
        App->>Prompt: render validation-repair pair
        App->>Agent: repair complete draft without tools
        App->>Deck: normalize and validate once
    end
    opt Mermaid syntax is invalid
        App->>Prompt: render Mermaid-repair pair with snapshot and error
        App->>Agent: return guarded RFC 6902 patch
        App->>Deck: apply patch and validate once
    end
    opt semantic review enabled
        App->>Prompt: render review pair with source and deck snapshot
        App->>Agent: return guarded RFC 6902 patch
        App->>Deck: test revisions, apply patch, and validate
    end
    App->>Render: inspect 1280x720 slide layout
    loop each overflowing slide, at most once
        App->>Prompt: render focused layout-repair pair
        App->>Agent: repair only that slide
        App->>Deck: replace focused slide and validate
        App->>Render: compare layout metrics
    end
    App->>Deck: collect only project and generated images referenced by final Markdown
    App->>Tx: begin project slide transaction
    App->>Render: stage referenced images, theme, Mermaid SVGs, Markdown, and optional PDF
    App->>Tx: validate manifest and commit immutable revision
    Tx-->>App: committed revision and current pointer
    opt publish directory resolved
        App->>Publish: atomically publish processed PDF or remove stale PDF
        Publish-->>App: path or nonfatal warning
    end
    App-->>Client: GenerateSlidesResult with artifacts, review summary, warnings, and provenance
